Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.25,0:00:03.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}आपके चावल के एक छोटे से दाने के अंदर...\N{\fnInter\fs36\b0\c&HB9E3FF&}Inside one tiny grain of your rice...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.06,0:00:04.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}एक पूरी ज़िंदगी पल सकती है।\N{\fnInter\fs36\b0\c&HB9E3FF&}an entire life can grow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:06.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}लेकिन कैसे?\N{\fnInter\fs36\b0\c&HB9E3FF&}But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.25,0:00:08.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}ये है राइस वीविल, एक छोटा सा कीट,\N{\fnInter\fs36\b0\c&HB9E3FF&}This is the rice weevil, a tiny insect
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.61,0:00:11.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}जो चावल ही नहीं, गेहूँ और दूसरे अनाज को भी\N{\fnInter\fs36\b0\c&HB9E3FF&}that harms not just rice, but wheat
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.53,0:00:13.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}नुकसान पहुंचा सकता है।\N{\fnInter\fs36\b0\c&HB9E3FF&}and other grains too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.20,0:00:16.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}मादा वीविल दाने में एक छोटा सा छेद बनाती है,\N{\fnInter\fs36\b0\c&HB9E3FF&}The female makes a tiny hole in the grain,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.70,0:00:18.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}उसमें अंडा देती है\N{\fnInter\fs36\b0\c&HB9E3FF&}lays an egg inside it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.25,0:00:21.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}और उसे एक खास स्राव से बंद कर देती है।\N{\fnInter\fs36\b0\c&HB9E3FF&}and seals it with a special secretion.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.30,0:00:24.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}अंडे से निकलने वाला लार्वा बाहर नहीं आता।\N{\fnInter\fs36\b0\c&HB9E3FF&}The larva that hatches never comes out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.75,0:00:26.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}वो दाने के अंदर ही\N{\fnInter\fs36\b0\c&HB9E3FF&}It stays inside the grain,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.47,0:00:29.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}उसका पोषण खाते हुए बढ़ता रहता है।\N{\fnInter\fs36\b0\c&HB9E3FF&}growing as it feeds on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.30,0:00:33.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}इसके बाद ये प्यूपा बनता है\N{\fnInter\fs36\b0\c&HB9E3FF&}Next, it becomes a pupa,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.73,0:00:36.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}और धीरे-धीरे एक नया वयस्क वीविल\N{\fnInter\fs36\b0\c&HB9E3FF&}and slowly a new adult weevil
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.62,0:00:38.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}तैयार हो जाता है।\N{\fnInter\fs36\b0\c&HB9E3FF&}takes shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.10,0:00:41.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}और जब ये बाहर निकलता है,\N{\fnInter\fs36\b0\c&HB9E3FF&}And by the time it emerges,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.99,0:00:43.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}तब तक दाना अंदर से\N{\fnInter\fs36\b0\c&HB9E3FF&}the grain has been
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.76,0:00:46.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}काफी हद तक खोखला हो चुका होता है।\N{\fnInter\fs36\b0\c&HB9E3FF&}largely hollowed out from inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.35,0:00:47.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}इसलिए अनाज को सूखा और\N{\fnInter\fs36\b0\c&HB9E3FF&}So keep grains dry
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.97,0:00:49.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}अच्छी तरह बंद डिब्बों में रखें।\N{\fnInter\fs36\b0\c&HB9E3FF&}in tightly sealed containers.
